window.products.push({"id":946084,"name":"Vipp VIPP13 Rubbish bin, 4 litres, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YbeqY7sbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This classic pedal bin from Vipp is a must for all households. The hallmark of an original Vipp bin is the dampening mechanism that allows the lid to close in a soft, silent motion as well as a rubber ring that closes the airtight seal. The body of the Vipp pedal bin is made of powder-coated steel and conceals the removable inner bucket made of galvanised steel. The galvanised inner container ensures hygienic disposal of waste. A rubber ring under the Vipp bucket ensures a firm stand on the tiles and protects sensitive surfaces. The history of Vipp began in 1939 when Danish artisan Holger Nielsen was asked by his wife for a pedal bin for her hairdresser. Initially, he only made buckets for this salon, but soon the local dentist was interested in it. . . so the story of Vipp took its course. From 1939, the pedal bins were used in hairdressing salons, doctor's practices and clinics. Their robustness and timeless elegance quickly made it an icon of Danish style. Today, they are not only negotiated among business partners worldwide, but also exhibited in design museums, e.g. in the Danish Design Centre and in MoMA New York. The Vipp pedal bins are still made in Denmark, just like in 1939. And the material has remained the same: stainless steel and rubber. Each Vipp pedal bin consists of up to 42 individual parts, which are assembled by skilled craftsmen. One employee assembles about six buckets per hour.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YbeqY7sbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vipp","source_asin":"B000OM457I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000OM457I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000OM457I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
