window.products.push({"id":946185,"name":"Anyfish 12.6 Inch Wok Pan with Lid Carbon Steel Stir Fry Pan with Chopsticks and Wooden Spatula for Electric, Induction, Ceramic & Gas Stoves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yuQ790tIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【INCLUDES】You not only get a 12.5 inch carbon steel pan and wooden lid, but also get 5 accessories include two pairs of chopsticks and wooden spatula. Anyfish stir frying wok pan can serve at least 3-5 food portions which is ideal for entire family use or a small friend-gathering. Light weight of only 2.75lbs enables you to toss food around, flip and stir-fry easily while cooking, which is friendly to women. 【HONEYCOMB DESIGN & CARBON STEEL CONSTRUCTION】The stir fry pan’s surface has a honeycomb design which reduce food sticking to the pan, reduces scratches and maintains the beauty of the wok. Made with HIGH-QUALITY black carbon steel, which features with NON-CHEMICAL COATING, the carbon steel wok pan ensures SUPERB NON-STICK PERFORMANCE and DURABILITY for lifetime using. 【HEAT SOURCES & COOKING WAYS】The size of this wok pan is 12.5\"W and 3.7\"D, which offers a wide & deep cooking surface ideal for stir frying, steaming, boiling, braising and searing. The wok pan with lid is perfectly suitable for gas, ceramic, open fire, electric, halogen or induction stoves, and oven. The wok pan is equipped with superior performance on HEAT CONDUCTION and DISTRUBUTION, so you can enjoy low-fat cooking with less oil. 【DETACHABLE HANDLE & WOODEN LID】The wood handle is detachable with no tools required, convenient for oven use and easy storage. The long wooden handle is designed for comfortable grip and heat-resistant characteristic.The hanging ring on handle is designed for hanging storage, easy to dry, saving kitchen space. The wooden lid to precise match the wok stir fry pan and accelerate to your cooking. 【High Quality & After-Sale Service】This carbon steel wok pan requires SEASON !! Anyfish wok pans set has 100% passed the quality tests, if you receive this Chinese wok pan with any damage, please feel free to contact Anyfish’s service team directly for any questions. Our customer support is ready and waiting to assist with anything you need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yuQ790tIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anyfish","source_asin":"B09P7Y5BP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P7Y5BP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P7Y5BP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
