window.products.push({"id":946218,"name":"FEBEEK Vacuum-able Glass Food Storage Jars set with Airtight Lid, 4 Pack Clear Glass Kitchen Canisters Set with Base & Manul Pump for Keep Food Fresh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zwam6Yp4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE YOUR SPACE MORE TIDY -- Use the glass canisters set to storage your food and stack them on your counter or storage room, the clear glass jar with label is convenient for observation and makes your space more tidy and beautiful HIGH-QUALITY & BPA-FREE -- The jar is made of high-quality borosilicate glass, the sealing lid is made of high-end PMMA and silica gel, so they can safely protect your various foods IDEAL AIRTIGHT GLASS STORAGE CANISTER -- It has good airtightness to ensure that the food in the glass jars is stored safely and kept fresh. It is an ideal airtight kitchen canisters for snack, sugar, cookie, flour and other food IDEAL VACUUM SEAL CONTAINER - The airtight lid has a one-way valve, you can pump out the air in the jars to preserve your food in a vacuum. It is an ideal vacuum container for coffee, spices, guacamole that are easily affected by oxygen EASY TO CLEAN & USE -- It contains 4 pack of H-2.4\",H-4.7\", H-4.7\", H-7.1\"; φ-3.9''glass jars, which can be washed in dishwasher. The sealed lid can be washed in water and it with a handle is convenient for you to open or move the vacuum seal jar. It also has a base to protect the jars, So it's also an ideal vacuum glass container for guacamole or other liquid foods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zwam6Yp4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FEBEEK","source_asin":"B09BQSV1MK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BQSV1MK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BQSV1MK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":946219,"name":"Kombucha Heating Wrap - Fermentation Heating Pad With Temperature Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hw-zLi81L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"MADE FOR KOMBUCHA BREWERS BY KOMBUCHA BREWERS I've been brewing kombucha for many years. After many frustrating attempts to find the perfect kombucha heating wrap I've decided to create one myself. I focused on three main things - temperature settings, usability, and durability. 3 Temperature Settings The temperature of your brew is one of the most important factors in producing yummy kombucha. Yeast loves the heat. That's why you need to keep your brewing vessel at the right temperatures throughout the brewing process. The problem is, the surrounding temperature changes with the season. A heating pad that works in the summer is not going to to work in the winter. After many test brews, I've finally found the best temperature settings for each season. Just set and forget according to the season and your tastes - you can be confident your brew will turn out great each time! Designed To Fit 1-Gallon Brewing Vessels One thing I hated about my other heating wraps was taking them off to check the temperature. I've made this wrap slightly shorter than the others so you can easily see the temperature of your brewing without having to take off the wrap. It's designed to fit conventional 1-gallon brewing vessels. Will Keep Your Brew Warm Through The Entire Brewing Cycle This mat is designed to be left on for extended periods of time. It will have no problem keeping all your brews warm 24 hours a day through the entire brewing cycle. This includes both the first and the second ferments! Durable and Waterproof I've always been worried about using a heat source around kombucha. That's why I've designed this wrap to be splash resistant. It takes the worry out of brewing next to liquids!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hw-zLi81L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hemlock Home Brewing","source_asin":"B07W1B44DV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W1B44DV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W1B44DV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
