window.products.push({"id":946474,"name":"Joyeee 8.7'' Castle Christmas Cake Mold Pan, Silicone Baking Mold for Birthday Cake, Muffin, Bread, Pie, Flan, Tart, Mousse, Non-Stick Baking Trays, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XaT4gu1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About the Product: 100% Food Grade Silicone Flexible＆Easy to Release Easy Clean＆Dishwasher Washable Temperature to use: These molds are used in oven, microwave oven, freezer and dishwasher.  Temperature from -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit (-40 to +230 degrees Celsius). Size: 8.7''L x 3.5''H Color: Random Package includes: 1 pack The Advantage: Our silicone molds will make your loved family healthy.Our silicone products DO NOT have Chemical Coatings and are Pinch Test Passed.  Whether in a big birthday party, small holiday party, wedding showers, baby showers, Easter or Mother's Day, anniversary etc, you can make delicious and beautiful Chocolates, Bread, Cakes and more for your family and friends. This silicone mold is fantastic for making: Tart, Chocolates, Soap, Candles, Loaf, Fondant, Jelly, Custard, Cheesecake, Brownie, frozen yogurt treats, Pie, Flan and so much. If you are a DIY enthusiast, please choose our baking molds, make sweet and surprise for your family and friends. Note: If you grease the silicone mold with a little butter, the muffins are very easy to remove. To make the contents easier to get out, a kind of lip is worked on the upper edge so that the dough can not overflow. The silicone mold can be easily cleaned in the dishwasher after baking. Warm Tips: ＊Do not expose directly to the sun ＊Keep away from fire and sharp knives ＊Soak with boiled water before first using ＊Please leave a 1-3mm error due to manual measurement. I sincerely hope you can understand it! Thank you! 100% Satisfaction Guarantee We stand by our products. If you have any dissatisfaction on the quality of goods, please contact us, we are willing to send you a new goods or a refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XaT4gu1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joyeee","source_asin":"B07MH46K28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MH46K28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MH46K28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
