window.products.push({"id":946543,"name":"Electric Kettle With Display,1200W Gooseneck Water Heater Electric for Coffee & Tea,30oz Pour Over Coffee Kettle with Ultra Fast,100% Stainless, Auto ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W6FS4SagL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【 Gooseneck Design & Precise Pouring】 Gooseneck Electric Water kettle looks as graceful as a swan, the sharp spout design enables precise pouring when brewing coffee or tea, the counter balanced handle helps you to pour steadily and easily and is not easy to spill. ☕【 To-the-degree Temp Control & Real-time Display】 Electric Tea Kettle The temp setting knob can precisely adjust the you deserve temperature and the LCD display panel can show the real temperature. With the built-in Brew Stopwatch, you can use electric teapot as a stopwatch only or keep track of your brew time, which means you can get a fresh cup of pour-over coffee at home anytime. ☕【 Advanced Intelligent Technology & Safe to Use】 The Electric Gooseneck Kettle is made with 304 food-grade stainless steel in its housing, lid, and spout without chemical linings, Coffee Kettle which keeps the perfect taste for your coffee and tea. Heat water safely with boil-dry protection and automatic shut-off when your water reaches the right temperature or after 1 hour of Keep Warm Mode. Multiple protection for your safety. ☕【0.9L for Home Use & Rapid Boil 】With a rated power of 1200W, the gooseneck electric kettle could boil a full pot of water in just 3–5 minutes, spending less time waiting and more time enjoying tea or coffee with families or guests. The water boiler is much more durable and robust, Gooseneck Tea Kettle electric quality-assured materials ensure the water is boiled to a high standard and with no objectionable odor. ☕【 Accurate electric kettle Temperature Control & Keep Warm for 60Mins】Electric Kettles Gooseneck set to keep warm for 60 minutes based on scientific results, boiled water is not good for your health if you leave it for too long. The precise water temperature matches the tea or coffee beans, so that you could taste the original taste better. 🎁 【The Ideal Gift】The gooseneck electric kettle boasts a sleek and stylish design that will complement any kitchen. It makes for an ideal holiday or birthday gift for family and friends who enjoy creating café-style drinks at home. 💝【Quality Assurance】 Electric Gooseneck Kettle strives for the quality of the product and always follows the principle of the buyer's shopping experience first. If you have any questions or requirements about the product, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W6FS4SagL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Larmstom","source_asin":"B0BWQZNGFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWQZNGFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWQZNGFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
