window.products.push({"id":946612,"name":"Poyet Motte Chevreuse Heavyweight Wool Blend Oversized Blanket, Machine Washable (Grey Plaid, King Size)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sir-B4ynL._AC_SL1101_.jpg","description":"Poyet Motte Chevreuse Heavyweight Wool Blend Blanket—Wool is known as Natures Best Insulator and High Performance Fabric. Wool fibers naturally absorb and wick moisture (sweat) away from the skin keeping you drier and more comfortable on the coldest of nights and in the harshest conditions. It even insulates when wet making it perfect for camping, hunting or simply any place an extra warm heavyweight blanket is needed. The Chevreuse blanket was initially designed for the Military to be an extremely functional and durable blanket able to withstand the harshest conditions. Because of its performance and popularity we manufactured a civilian version in two color patterns. Constructed with Yarn Dyed 67-percent wool/33-percent acrylic creates a blanket that is exceptionally warm and beautiful. The manufacturing process creates a tight woven whipstitch style to give the blanket a truly unique look and feel. A fold over double stitch hem is sewn on all four sides to add strength and a clean crisp edge. This blanket fits both king and California king size beds and measures an oversized 108-by-96 inches. Conveniently machine washable in cold water and line dry. Made in France by Poyet Motte. Established in 1839, Poyet Motte is reputed all thru out Europe as a leading manufacturer of high-quality blankets. We do our own manufacturing at our mill in Cours-La-Ville, France which is located in the central part of the country approximately 470km SW of Paris.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sir-B4ynL._AC_SL1101_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fccvoll","source_asin":"B07BDR9GLB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BDR9GLB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BDR9GLB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":946613,"name":"Santa Tell Me Karate Ornament Personalized Karate 2022 Boy Taekwondo Ornament, Martial Art Ornament Custom Figurine Kickboxing Ju Jitsu Kids Men Teach","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fp5h5mJNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Karate Ornament Personalized Karate Christmas Gift 2022 Boy Taekwondo Ornament, Martial Art Ornament Custom Figurine Kickboxing Ju Jitsu Kids Men Teacher Instructor Judo Gifts, Sensei Gifts for Boy If you are looking for a Christmas gift for kids or unique Christmas gift for Men or Women, Our Sports Ornament collection will be a perfect personalized Christmas Ornaments for Kids or Personalized Christmas Ornament 2022. Your friends or family members will love these golfer gifts runner gifts or tennis gifts. They are also very cute gifts for teams as football player ornaments, basketball ornaments, soccer ornaments, etc. This Customized Ornament can be used as cute figurines on walls or may be a perfect match for your Christmas Tree. Every Christmas everyone wonders and asks. - Santa Tell Me, What Will You Bring Us?🎅🎁🎄 And here is a surprise from him! It is not only a gift, but a gift specially prepared for your name and year designed for each special occasion. Santa is always watching you; He prepared each ornament as a memory of milestones in your life: You will fall in LOVE with our store. We have a wide collection including; Baby’s First Christmas Ornament, Kid Ornament, First Day Of School Ornament, Graduation Ornament, Profession Ornament– (Nurse, Teacher and many more!)Engagement Ornament, Married Ornament, Baby Expecting Ornament, Family Ornaments, Sports Ornaments (Football Ornament, Basketball Ornament, Golf Ornament), Dog Ornament, Cat Ornament and many others! If you need Personalized Ornament 2022, you are in good hands. Welcome to Santa Tell Me family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Fp5h5mJNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Tell Me","source_asin":"B0BC9D3M8N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC9D3M8N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC9D3M8N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
