window.products.push({"id":946643,"name":"PUREBURG Replacement HEPA Filter Set Compatible with Blueair 500/600 Smokestop Classic 503 505 603 650E 550E 501 510 555EB 601 605 580i 680i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gm8ODerhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PUREBURG Replacement HEPA Filter Set Compatible with Blueair 500/600 Smokestop Classic 503 505 603 650E 550E 501 510 555EB 601 605 580i 680i Disclaimer: This product is a generic item that is designed to replace the original part.  Any brand names or logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of any brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. PUREBURG - Pure Your Breath! We value your satisfaction. If you have any problems using our product, please always contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gm8ODerhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PUREBURG","source_asin":"B07STBBBTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07STBBBTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07STBBBTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":946644,"name":"Humidifiers for Bedroom Air Humidifier for Kids 3.3L Top Fill Mist Large Humidifier for Home 2020 Upgraded 3-in-1 Ultrasonic Humidifier Adjustable Mis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VHasqdTjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mist Spray Control: 1, First click the button to turn on the humidifier, it will be the continuous spray mode first, the ambient light flashes for seconds and then goes out. 2, Second click the button again to switch to the intermittent spray mode. 3, Third click the button to turn off the humidifier. Ambient Light Control: 1, First click the button to turn on the humidifier, it will be the continuous spray mode first, the ambient light flashes for seconds and then goes out.  2, Long press the button and hold for about 5 seconds during the continuous spray or intermittent spray the ambient light will start and switch among 7 colors. 3, Long press and hold for about 5 seconds again to turn off the lights. Instruction for how to replace the cotton swab: 1, Hold the plastic tube on the outside of the cotton swab, gently rotate and pull it out. Replace it with a replacement cotton swab. Note that there is a small spring device in the plastic tube. Do not drop it when pulling it out, otherwise the product will not work. 2, Replace the cotton swab, and then carefully insert the plastic tube into its position. Then pay attention to adding water to allow the new cotton swab to absorb water. And let the cotton swab completely wet before spraying. For Cotton Swab: Actually there is no need to replacement if the cotton swab and the whole humidifier works well. We sent 4 free-gift cotton swabs in the package in the purpose that occassionally the cotton swabs cannot fits the ultrasonic mechanism well. Warm tips: TOO MUCH oil essential(but not the suggested drops of essential) which would shorten the cotton swabs' lifetime.  If the cotton swabs work OK but you would not use the humidifier in the near future(maybe weeks or months), we suggest you take out the swabs and dry them before storaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VHasqdTjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TSKF","source_asin":"B0834YFL9B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0834YFL9B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0834YFL9B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
