window.products.push({"id":946665,"name":"Customized Blanket Custom Super Soft Flannel Blanket with Picture Upload -Personalized Photo Blanket Gifts for Mom Father Baby New Mom Baby Best Frien","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hFvL5kE5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT CUSTOMIZED GIFT: Warm customizable blanket with personalized photo or text is the best family heartwarming gift for dad, mom, grandma, grandpa, father of the bride, father of the groom and other elders gifts for women or men, and souvenirs for various anniversaries or festivals, such as Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Valentine's Day, Halloween,Birthday,Wedding,Six Month Commemorative Gift, 1st Anniversary Gift, it is also a cute gift for your pet. CUSTOMIZATION STEPS FOR PERSONALIZED PHOTO BLANKET: Select the size you need, click the Customize button, upload your beautiful memories, after receiving the photos you upload, we will make them into a personalized gift, trust your loved ones It is sure to feel very warm to receive this gift. PHOTO BLANKETS WITH HIGH-QUALITY FABRICS: Our personalised picture blankets are made from pilling-resistant flannel,which is super soft,lightweight,non-toxic, prevent allergies,and non-shedding.We use environmental protection throughout the production process.Printing inks and high-quality printing technology print your photos clearly on the blanket without any special smell. OCCASION: Can be used in office, bed, etc. as a decorative blanket, a customizable personalized photo gift for adults, best friends, , friends, girls, boys, sisters, sister-in-law, couples, mothers, or As an anniversary gift, commemorative gift for boyfriend and girlfriend, I believe they will feel very warm when they receive this loving gift. EXCELLENT SERVICE: 1. If you need the print preview designed by us, please leave us a message. 2. If you are not satisfied with the blanket after receiving the goods, we will send you a brand blanket or give you a full refund, you can buy it with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hFvL5kE5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Masrtuli","source_asin":"B0B9JGCJW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9JGCJW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9JGCJW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
