window.products.push({"id":946718,"name":"FAAY 3-in-1 Wooden Spatulas, Kitchen Utensils, Cooking Utensil, 100% Healthy Utensils from High Moist Resistance Teak, Eco-Friendly Wood Spatula for N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E9xOhas7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌱100% CAREFREE COOKING EXPERIENCE Thinking of our valuable customers who love cooking, we created the set of 3 spatulas: Stir fry, Slotted, and Compact. Since each utensil serves different functions, we want to see you cook, flip, and stir fry everything gently while paying less. Our spatulas are ergonomically designed to be conveniently used. Their flat wide blades are easy to get under large quantity of food. Their long and lightweight handles will definitely help better your cooking quality 🌱100% HEALTHY AND ECO-FRIENDLY Our FAAY Teak Spatulas / Turners are from sustainable source of teaks in Thailand. Teaks are well known to be heat and moist resistant. Please be noted that the product color depends on types of soil (It can be either dark or light golden brown). No glue or lacquer added, only coconut oil finished. This is just to ensure our valuable customers’ good health. 🌱100% HANDMADE AND HEARTCRAFTED BY LOCAL CRAFTSMEN AND CRAFTSWOMEN Most of the wooden utensils nowadays are machinemade. Every piece of our products helps the local artisans maintain their remarkable craft skill and pass it down to the next generations. They are genuine artists, and they just need a little space to express their talent. Only you can provide them with that. 🌱100% EASY TO TAKE CARE Wash them with warm water and soft sponge to preserve their qualities. We recommend you dry them by hanging. If there is something sticking to our spatulas, just put them in the water for 5 minutes before washing. Please store them in dry place when not used. When teak products are exposed to oil and heat, their color normally becomes darker, but they are still perfectly useable 🌱100% WARRANTY GUARANTEED In case our spatulas do not come in their best condition like in the photo or get broken after being used for 30 days, just let us know. We sincerely apologize and will definitely send you the new ones in no time. We appreciate all your remarks and comments. They are the key tools to develop and improve our handmade and heartcrafted products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E9xOhas7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAAY","source_asin":"B07435BXQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07435BXQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07435BXQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":946719,"name":"Delta Blinds Supply Custom-Made, Premium Real Wood Horizontal Almost White Window Blinds, 2 Inch Slats, Inside Mount","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-9RpU54KL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Our Premium Real Wood blinds are the finest quality blinds available. Our almost white is best described as an antique white. In the 4 years that we have manufactured this product, we have never heard of a case where our real wood has experienced warping. However, to be on the safe side, we recommend this material for non-humid rooms (living rooms, dining rooms, and bedrooms.) Who is Delta Blinds Supply? We are a manufacturer located in the state of Georgia. Our facility is over 100,000 sq. ft. and we provide quality Faux Wood and real wood window blinds. We custom make all blinds down to the very 1/8\" that you require. If you don't see the size you require here on Amazon, call (678)745-4113 to directly reach Erica, customer service at Delta Blinds Supply. MEASURING INSTRUCTIONS: Please do not use the measurements of a blind that you will have replaced. Instead, please see our photo on this Amazon page called \" Measuring Instructions for Inside Mount Blinds.\" Our blinds are recommended for window casings that are at least 3\" deep because if less than that, the blinds will protrude and you will be able to see the metal installation brackets from a side angle (VALANCES DO NOT COME WITH CORNER SIDE PIECES.) We STRONGLY RECOMMEND requesting FREE COLOR SAMPLES from us so that you are completely satisfied, please call (678)745-4113 to request free samples or Contact Us on Amazon. All computer monitors are different from one another, therefore, the colors that you see online may not be 100% accurate to what you see in person. DELTA BLINDS SUPPLY'S RETURN POLICY: Buyers pay for return shipping, a 30% restocking fee on all blind returns as they are all custom made per order. Please verify and confirm the sizes and colors of your order are accurate to your needs so that you are completely satisfied. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-9RpU54KL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Blinds Supply","source_asin":"B01GVYL174","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GVYL174","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GVYL174","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
