window.products.push({"id":946774,"name":"HOME-X 8 Pc Shellfish Utensil Set, 2 Lobster and Crab Crackers and 6 Seafood Forks, Seafood Tool Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V9sZhvH5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you a fan of shellfish but not a fan of the process of breaking through the difficult shell? Our Shellfish Utensil Set makes opening lobster and crab shells a breeze! The set comes with two heavy-duty metal shell crackers and six durable shellfish forks. The shell crackers break open the strong shells of all kinds of shellfish with a breeze, leaving enough room for you to use the forks to scoop out the tasty meat from inside. This set of shellfish tools is perfect for cookouts, barbecues, and boils where shellfish is the main course. It's a pain to open shells with your hands. Not only do they require a bit of strength to open, but you could also cut yourself on the jagged ends if you break through. With our Shellfish Utensil Set, you'll no longer have to use your hands or any other inefficient tools or utensils to open shellfish. The crackers aren't just good for lobsters and crabs. You can even use one to break through the tough shells of nuts, like pistachios, walnuts, and pecans. This set is sure to impress friends and family with its impressive versatility and makes a wonderful gift for housewarmings, weddings, and anniversaries. Lobster and crab are some of the greatest bounties from the sea, so don't miss out just because it can be discouraging to get them open. Whether you cook shellfish on the grill, boil it in a pot, or just serve it cold, our Shellfish Utensil Set can make the whole experience a lot easier and a lot more fun. Buy one of these useful Shellfish Utensil Sets today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V9sZhvH5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B082F69GYZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082F69GYZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082F69GYZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
