window.products.push({"id":946784,"name":"Peugeot Madras Mill, 6-1/2-Inch, Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RYSSPWIYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Advantage of Freshly Ground Spices There are many benefits to freshly grinding pepper, salt, herbs and spices for cooking and seasoning. A quality mill with a specifically designed grinding mechanism will release the aromas and essential oils of that spice. Freshly ground pepper and spices have more aroma and better flavor than pre- ground. Another advantage of using freshly ground spices or minerals (salts) is the control a mill provides for determining the coarseness (size) of a grind. A high quality pepper, salt or spice mill gives you the ability to choose and change the coarseness according to taste or necessity. How to Choose a Good Mill When looking for a pepper, salt or spice grinder, consider the following: Grinding mechanism: Choose a grinding mechanism that can withstand daily use: one that is well made and produces a consistent grind. Ideally, the grinding mechanism should be designed to handle a specific spice, as each spice has different physical characteristics that will benefit from different design features. Design and appearance: Whether it's traditional or modern, manual or electric, a mill can be an indispensable tool in your kitchen and a beautiful part of table d�cor. Ease of Use: A quality mill should be easy to adjust, easy to fill, and feel comfortable in the hand. History of Peugeot Peugeot's story starts in the 19th century when the Peugeot brothers converted the family's gristmill into a steel foundry. They began producing award winning hand tools immediately after opening and went on to produce a diverse range of exceptional quality products including small appliances, bicycles and most notably, automobiles. (Although now operating as a separate company, the Peugeot car company continues the same commitment to quality and innovation that is a Peugeot hallmark). In 1840 Peugeot created their burr style coffee grinder and adopted that design to accommodate peppercorns in 1874. The resulting pepper mechanism design is still used today in every Peugeot pepper mill. Peugeot's iconic pepper grinding mechanism design is often copied, but never equaled. Today, Peugeot offers six unique spice-specific mechanisms plus the original burr-style coffee grinder. There are no shortcuts: each mechanism is designed to get the most out of the spices they are intended for. After more than 160 years, Peugeot mills and grinders remain the benchmark of the industry and have earned their position as the mill of choice in world class kitchens. It's All About the Mechanism The primary difference between Peugeot and all other brands are the spice-specific mechanisms. Peugeot has 7 unique spice specific mechanisms for pepper, salt, herbs and spices, coffee, wet salt, chili peppers and nutmeg. For each spice, there is one - and only one - Peugeot grinding mechanism, each made of the ideal design and constructed from the best material available for its intended use. All Peugeot mechanisms are made in France and carry a lifetime limited warranty. Peugeot's Pepper Grinding Mechanism is a two stage burr-style system. During production, the helix-shaped grooves and grinding teeth of the pepper mechanism are individually cut before the steel is case hardened to make it virtually indestructible. The mechanism is then given a proprietary treatment to provide additional protection against corrosion. During use, the helix- shaped grooves guide whole peppercorns through the mechanism to crack, then grind to a consistent size by a double row of teeth. This process releases the pepper's essential oils, resulting in more flavor and aroma for your dish. This patented mechanism is found on every Peugeot Pepper mill and is widely considered the best pepper mechanism available Peugeot's Salt Crushing Mechanism features two ribbed plates which work to fracture and crush coarse, dry sea salt to a consistent size. The salt grinding mechanism is made of corrosion resistant Stainless Steel, and is found on every Peugeot Salt Mill. A Peugeot Innovation u'Select is Peugeot's patented grind control system for electric and manual grinders. Beyond personal preferences, different stages of the preparation / cooking process and different dishes often call for seasonings of varying sizes. Peugeot now offers the ability to quickly, easily and accurately adjust the grind settings with its patented u'Select system. From coarsely ground pepper or salt to very fine, u'Select offers: -6 pre-defined levels of grind for pepper, or any point in between. -6 pre-defined levels of grind for salt, or any point in between. Simplicity: just turn the ring at the base of the mill and select your grind size. The further you turn the ring, the finer or coarser the grind, depending on the direction turned. Precision: no risk that the grind will change during use. The right grind: You are assured that with each setting, the grind will be consistent, time after time. Fine or coarse grind-is it just a question of taste? Actually it depends on personal taste an","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RYSSPWIYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B09JX9YWFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JX9YWFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JX9YWFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":946785,"name":"COSIEST Vintage Nightstand, MDF 2-Tier Bedside Table, Wood Accent End Table with Storage Drawer and Open Display Shelf for Bedroom Living Room, Light ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QB6yde0vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Handsomely Crafted】 : This night stand is made of veneers as the top layer coat that covers the inner section, which is a blend of MDF and pine wood. It also has an antique grey finish that gives it a dashing look. It's further designed with one smooth-gliding drawers for storage purposes, which also has an attractive wood finish with an exquisitely carved pattern. Moreover, it is complemented with a smooth edge meant to avoid sharpness. ✅【Vintage Inspired】 : Drawing from ancient designs, this perfectly crafted one drawer nightstand has a drawer pull contrasting beautifully against the light grey wood. The carvings on the drawer faces emphasize the artistic touch. This is a vintage approach to the design, which adds more value to it, as crafting older designs gets more credit in this era. ✅【Storage Space】 : The bed side table has a drawer on the upper part, which is big enough to store as many accessories as you'd like. This allows you to leave the typical stuff, such as keys and receipts. In addition, there is an extra lower shelf under the table that can be used to place potted plants, books, and any other thing you’d like. The same applies to the top part of the table, which you can use to rest any décor that you see fit. ✅【Inclusive Design】 : Our master woodworkers are able to achieve the exquisite carvings of the legs using advanced modern techniques! The dimensions of this table are 18 inches in length and 14 inches in width on top and it stands 26.5 inches tall. The one drawer nightstand with shelf really warms up a bedroom and seem to create more space than it occupies. ✅【Lightweight】 : This nightstand with shelf weighs 15.6 pounds which is fair for its size. This makes it easy to move it from one spot to another at ease. You can even lift it alone when cleaning or rearranging your home's arrangement. Due to the weight and size, assembling the nightstand with drawer is easy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QB6yde0vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSIEST","source_asin":"B0C339Y3C1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C339Y3C1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C339Y3C1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
