window.products.push({"id":946793,"name":"Hapyvergo High Pressure Steam Cleaner, 1700W High Temp Portable Steamer Machine for Cleaning, Tankless and Heavy Duty for Commercial Home Use Grout Ti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JFdfsOoaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[MORE THAN 4 HOURS RUNTIME] Rigorous and excellent manufacturing allows it to meet commercial grade standards that can support it to work for long periods of time without overheating. Our recommended run time is 30 minutes, the intention is to stop the user to check if the nozzle is clogged. If not, just keep going! [TANKLESS DESIGN] The steam cleaner for home use has a built-in 4-foot water inlet hose, which can insert into the external bucket as a water source, which can generate continuous and steady natural steam. No need to hold heavy and bulky tank on hand! [1700W HIGH POWER] The high temperature steam will be ready in 20 seconds, up to 230℉, melting the greasy dirt and clean with the power of 3.5Bar pressurized natural steam. [PREMIUM QUALITY] Integrated ABS carrying case can bear up to 300lbs. And the built-in evaporator and electromagnetic pump are all made of 304# stainless steel, which is durable and will accompany you for many years. [DETERGENTS AVAILABLE] The high-quality liner allows you to add solutions or detergents to the water source to help you clean more cleanly. TIPS: (1) Make sure the solution is completely mixed; (2) Clean up the remaining solution in the machine after each use. [BUYERS TO KNOW & WARRANTY] Before leaving the factory, each unit will be tested, so there will be water traces on the water inlet hose. 1-year warranty: free replacement for any quality problems by non-human reasons. [ATTENTION] Please use the Cold Water Function to pump water into the machine every time before turning on the Steam Switch. Otherwise, due to the rapid heating of the evaporator, the internal pressure of the machine is too high to pump water! TIPS: Come with English manual, and the Spanish manual need to be downloaded at the bottom of this page. The first video of the pressure steam cleaner on this page is in English and the second is in Spanish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JFdfsOoaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hapyvergo","source_asin":"B09QFY34PF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QFY34PF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QFY34PF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
