window.products.push({"id":946801,"name":"Bakery Boxes 4x4x4\" [50Pack] by Cuisiner | Pastry Containers | Baby Shower, Dessert Packaging for Cake, Pies, Donut, Macaron, Cookies and Party Treat ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vBO+dBYOL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let the world see and taste your sweetest specialties! After hearing the oven timer, there’s still much work to do before your luscious and irresistible creations can be enjoyed by people eager to satisfy their cravings for sweet treats. Whether you’re in the baking business or a dedicated pastry chef, you know first-hand that first impression lasts—especially when it comes to the presentation and packaging of your delicious and enchanting desserts. It makes sense to shelter your baked treats inside a durable and elegant container. However, with all the options out there, choosing the right one is not a walk in the park. Most importantly, after all the effort you’ve poured in your dessert’s final touches, would you leave them hidden in the dark? Preserve your delectable dessert’s taste and presentation with Cuisiner Bakery Boxes! You’ve done hard work in baking so many batches of your famous cakes, pies, donuts and other sweat treats. Going the extra mile to store them inside elegant containers is nothing but appropriate. Our boxes are just what you need for that extra WOW factor on your scrumptious creations which will surely bring a smile to the face of anyone who indulges in them. Compared to other similar options, these boxes are more resistant to tearing and won’t fall apart despite holding heavier and bigger desserts. They’re made from eco-friendly and bleach-free paperboard for a worry-free and safe consumption. Still not convinced? More reasons to choose our boxes over other alternatives: ✅ Sleek white and brown color for all occasions ✅ Perfect size for your delicacies ✅ Multi-purpose and highly practical ✅ Also suitable for storing non-food items","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vBO+dBYOL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisiner","source_asin":"B07PVPV32N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PVPV32N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PVPV32N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
