window.products.push({"id":946827,"name":"Cambria® Total Blackout Clip Rings for Curtains, Heavy Duty Premium Curtain Clip Rings for Room Darkening Blackout Curtains, Set of 7, 1 1/4\", Brushed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613Mseo3l2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Total Blackout — Add a sleek and elegant look to your windows with the Blackout Clip Ring Set for Cambria room darkening curtain rods. Blackout curtains and draperies block out light, allowing you to get a deeper sleep. Multiple Luxurious Finishes — Cast in a variety of stylish finishes, these beautiful curtain ring clips allow you to easily hang room darkening curtains, adding a refined update to your window treatments. Expertly Designed — Sleek design gives your window treatments a polished update and gorgeous finish for an elegant appeal. Complete the Look — Coordinate with the Cambria Total Blackout adjustable curtain rods for a complete look (sold separately). All Cambria curtain rod sets and clip rings have a 1-year manufacturer's warranty. What’s Included — Set of 7 clip rings for curtains. The interior diameter of the curtain clip rings are 1 1/4\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613Mseo3l2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cambria","source_asin":"B0BLWCM7JL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLWCM7JL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLWCM7JL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":946828,"name":"Ideal Home Range Boston International IHR 3-Ply Paper Napkins, 20-Count Cocktail Size, Blue Grandeur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LOU2+fhvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create dynamic tablescapes and stunning place settings by pairing patterned napkins with matching plates and coordinating solids. Plates and napkins are offered in multiple sizes, allowing you to mix and match, layer and customize. Ideal Home Range offers a sustainable option for conscientious consumers, producing 100% biodegradable napkins using the safest tissues, inks and printing processes. IHR napkin tissue is 100% cellulose from cracked wood (fallen trees) and plantation wood (managed forests where trees are planted specifically for the production of paper materials) and all tissue is oxygen bleached without the use of chlorine. IHR ink is water soluble, contains no heavy metals or solvents of any kind and meets the requirements of German Food and Health laws and the USFDA. Used ink is never dumped into sewage and is always recycled and reintegrated into the color system. The production working area is naturally pollution-free and no harmful emissions are produced. IHR has earned a certificate of approval from the Forest Stewardship Council (FSC), a prestigious certificate only awarded to those who meet all of the FSC's standards for sustainability, forest management, well being of the forest workers and effects on indigenous peoples and the local environment. Ideal Home Range is exclusively represented in the United States by Boston International and is considered to be the international market leader and trendsetter in the field of high-class table decoration and interior accessories. IHR began in an old village school in Germany in 1977, when Ingrid and Hanjo Rick conceived the idea of producing accessories in the arts and crafts tradition in order to communicate their concept of interior design. They soon discovered the tissue napkin as a design object and the basis of stylish table decorations and turned it into the key feature of their product. More than 8,000 items are offered today in most countries of the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LOU2+fhvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ideal Home Range","source_asin":"B00J0VDVXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J0VDVXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J0VDVXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":946829,"name":"​​BloominGoods​ ​5​0 Gold Rimmed Plastic Plates ​| Disposable White Heavy Duty​ Plates | 25 Dinner​, ​25 Dessert/Appetizer Plates​ ​| Premium Combo Di","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t96ikrDkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you’re hosting an event, do you want to spend time washing dishes and missing out on all the fun? Or would you rather socialize and entertain your guests? With BloominGoods Gold Rimmed Disposable Dinner and Dessert Plates you can host an elegant party and enjoy it too. Unlike ordinary plastic plates, these are made using heavyweight plastic construction that is resistant to breaking and bending . The 100% food grade plastic is also BPA- and toxic-free to ensure a safe eating experience for you and your guests. These plates will add a touch of sophistication to any event with its radiant shine . Your guests will feel like they’re eating off of real china when they see the elegant rims creating a beautiful contrast against the white background . The 50-pack set includes 25 gold rimmed 10.25\" Inch dinner plates and 25 gold rimmed 7.5\" inch dessert plates, making them ideal for any special event. Add a modern touch to birthdays, anniversary parties, weddings, graduations and even outdoor barbecues as you serve your guests in style . When the event is over, you can simply dispose of the recyclable plates and save yourself extensive, clean-up time . There are no broken dishes, expensive rental fess or dishpan hands to worry about. Of course, if you can’t bear to part with these elegant dishes, you can also hand wash them for re-use so you can boast them over and over again. The choice is yours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t96ikrDkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BloominGoods","source_asin":"B07BN5Q83Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BN5Q83Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BN5Q83Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
