window.products.push({"id":946873,"name":"Joiedomi 9Ft Artificial Christmas Garland Prelit with 50 Count Light, Plug in Lighted for Home & Office Christmas Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1KgbzdsozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT XMAS DÉCOR: Light up and enjoy your Christmas with Joiedomi Prelit Christmas Pine Garland LIGHT-UP GARLAND: Pre-lit with warm white clear lights. Also, the garland is designed with end socket to connect another light-up garland. Connect Up To 5 Sets PROPER SIZE: Measures 9 ft. long and 10-inch diameter, which is good for home or office decoration EASY SET UP: Hang it from a mantle, door, stair rail or any place you want it to drape BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: If the one you received fail to work, “Contact Seller” and we will refund you or ship you a replacement. We stand behind our Products!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1KgbzdsozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joiedomi","source_asin":"B07XSHRRV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946873","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XSHRRV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XSHRRV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":946874,"name":"Ernst Birnbaum wood pulp Bannetons, Brotforms, Dough Rising Baskets (1000g, 9\" round, lined)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eZYlVZWML._AC_.jpg","description":"Wood Pulp Proofing Baskets from Germany – Round Lined (Concentric Circles). Accommodates a 2– 2 1/2 lb loaf with inner diameter of 22 cm (8.75 inches). The wood pulp material consists of defibered conifer wood (spruce) and so it is 100% pure and natural. Ecologically, this material is better than cane. Water is added to the wood pulp during the production process and the resulting slurry is filled into a compression molding die. Then the moisture is pressed from the slurry and forms the proofing basket in the shape of the die. The resulting basket is dried for several weeks in the open air. Afterwards it is polished and ready for shipping. NOTE; DO NOT USE WATER TO CLEAN. The bannetons made of wood pulp are even better suited for private individuals (home bakers). This is explained as follows: better heat absorption is needed as most homebakers do not have a proofing cabinet it is easier to extract the dough as it doesn't stick to the creases of the wood pulp bannetons, unlike those made of cane better moisture absorption by the banneton (giving it back to the doughg as needed) improves the dough rising. easier cleaning. Usage manual for wood pulp and cane bannetons The bannetons are only to be used for the fermentation of the dough and for forming the bread loaves. Never put them in the oven when baking the bread. It's possible that they catch fire when getting to hot. Please dust the bannetons with flour before using them. Then put the dough-loaf in in and let it rise for the time needed. Before using the bannetons please clean them by patting the remaining flour and dried dough out of it. The dry bannetons should be stored separated so that no mold grows between the tucked damp baskets. Cleaning Please clean the bannetons regularly. Depending on your usage pattern between 4 to 12 weeks you should brush the bannetons with a hard brush. If possible put the bannetons in the oven with a temperature of about 260 degrees Fahrenheit) for about 45 minutes to dry them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eZYlVZWML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ernst Birnbaum Company","source_asin":"B08K6376HT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K6376HT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K6376HT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":946875,"name":"EUBSWA Stove Top Shelf Magnetic, Silicone Spice Rack Organizer Over the Stove, Zero Installation Stove Shelf, Baffles All Around, Non-Slip, Heat Insul","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+q4N8GYnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"magnetic shelf for stove [Space Saving] As a shelf above the stove, it provides a nice level surface for storing your oils, spices, etc. You can keep all your frequently used cooking spices, spices and oils in three sections within easy reach instead of having to look in the cabinets every time. This is a very nice convenience and addition to the kitchen. [Anti-fall Design] Since it is made of silicone, it is flexible but it is thick enough to feel sturdy. It has several partitions to help keep the shelf rigid and the inside has a geometric pattern that adds helps to keep items from slipping. The lip on this stove will catch any spills of spices or other things you might put on it. There are handles etched into the sides for carrying. [Easy to Use] You don't need any adhesive to attach the shelf to the top of the stove. The top shelf is held steady by four magnets in series, and there are two more in the package, so the magnets hold the top of the stove so well that you can't feel it move if it gets bumped. After being folded and packed, it needs a little tidying up, but once you slap it on the stove, it basically holds itself in place. [Easy to Clean] It's a wonderful invention. It's easy to put in place and when it needs a good cleaning, it's easy to put back in place. This is because inevitably, oil and grease will build up during the use of the stove. If it eventually gets dirty or oily, you can put it on top of the dishwasher. [Orderly and Beautiful] This stove top rack is a great way to add a little storage space to your small, crowded kitchen. It both expands much-needed shelf space for salt, pepper, spices, etc., and helps close the gap between the top of the stove and the wall. This shelf makes your good-looking stove look even better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+q4N8GYnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EUBSWA","source_asin":"B0BWJM8HKD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-946875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWJM8HKD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWJM8HKD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
